                <head>Errata</head>
                <p>The following change has been made to <ref target="frus:frus1969-76v40">
                        <hi rendition="#italic">Foreign Relations</hi>, 1969–1976, Volume XL</ref>,
                    Germany and Berlin, 1969–1972. Please be aware that printed volumes have not
                    been revised. <!--Revised information is in italic.-->
                </p>
                <list type="simple">
                    <item>
                        <hi rendition="#bold">1. <ref target="#d263-f3">Footnote 3, Document
                                263</ref>, Page 765 (date of correction: January 3, 2013)</hi>
                    </item>
                    <item>The citation to “footnote 7” of Document 250 has been corrected as
                        “footnote 4.”</item>
                </list>
            </div>
